d  living in solitary confinement in a  foreign country but he was the youngest  person at the time to win an Oscar as a  result number 16 he was a busy guy you  might be intimidated by the idea of  shooting a feature film while learning  an instrument for another film but not  Samuel L Jackson who said he took six or  seven months to learn to play guitar for  his role as the blues singer Lazarus in  Black Snake Moan and while he was  learning the instrument he was also  shooting Snakes on a Plane we can't  believe the commitment these actors made  to their roles and the talent and skill  they've displayed through their musical  performances what are some of your  favorite on-screen musical moments let  us know in the comments
 

